    watchText:
      'On-call rotations and incident response are real. Part of this track\'s pay is compensation for being reachable when production breaks.',
    tags: ['Strong mid-career pay ceiling', 'Certifications add real premium', 'On-call is part of the job'],
  },
  {
    num: '04',
    badge: 'A chronic, genuine talent gap',
    title: 'Cybersecurity',
    body:
      'Protecting systems, data, and infrastructure — from SOC analyst and incident response work to cloud security, application security, and governance or compliance roles. India\'s security hiring need is commonly estimated in the hundreds of thousands against a much smaller pool of qualified professionals — a rare, genuinely favourable supply-demand gap inside CS hiring.',
    fitText: 'You like investigation, documentation, and finding the gap nobody else noticed.',
