    fitText: 'You like trade-offs and stakeholder conversations more than owning code alone.',
    watchText:
      'Associate-PM programmes at top companies accept a tiny fraction of applicants, and the day-to-day work is more political and consensus-heavy than the job title suggests.',
    tags: ['High ceiling at senior levels', 'Fewer entry seats than engineering', 'Political, not just analytical'],
  },
