  },
  {
    num: '09',
    badge: 'The smallest door',
    title: 'Core computer science research and academia',
    body:
      'PhD-track research inside a specific CS subfield — algorithms, systems, theory, or AI research itself — aimed at an academic or industry-research career. The smallest door on this list, and one with its own separate, later competitive stage.',
