    note: 'Treat the PhD as a valuable credential either way — but plan the industry-research backup before you need it, not after.',
  },
];

const aiKillPoints = [
  'Boilerplate code: CRUD endpoints, config scaffolding, basic test writing, first-draft documentation.',
  'Simple bug fixes and pattern-based refactors spread across a codebase.',
